WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.917
Looking for a website? Just describe it.

2
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:11.233
Walk down from fifteen topics to a single link, with a count of links at every step.

3
00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:21.300
Or describe the site in your own words. Results match on meaning as well as on words.

4
00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:30.300
Name a country or a religion in the sentence, and each becomes a chip you can remove.

5
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:37.900
Underneath, a database server built in Zig says ok only once a link is on disk.

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.867
One shared disk sync made bulk imports 14.3 times faster.

7
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:52.983
Describe the site you're looking for, at directory.junaid.guru.
